---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — GreenGains"
  description="How GreenGains collects, uses and protects your data."
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Effective date: January 19, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted [&_h2]:mb-3 [&_h2]:mt-2 [&_h2]:text-base [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-white [&_h3]:mb-2 [&_h3]:mt-4 [&_h3]:text-sm [&_h3]:font-medium [&_h3]:text-white/80 [&_a]:text-primary [&_a]:underline [&_ul]:mt-2 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_p+p]:mt-3">

      <section>
        <h2>Introduction</h2>
        <p>GreenGains ("we," "our," or "us") operated by Eremat is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our mobile app and related services.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

        <h3>Location data</h3>
        <p>We collect precise GPS location data while the app runs in the background:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Latitude and longitude coordinates</li>
          <li>Location accuracy (in metres)</li>
          <li>Altitude (when available)</li>
          <li>Location provider (GPS, network, or fused)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Location data is used to create geographic coverage maps and correlate environmental readings with specific areas.</p>

        <h3>Sensor data</h3>
        <p>We collect anonymous sensor readings from your device:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Barometric pressure</li>
          <li>Ambient light levels</li>
          <li>Accelerometer readings (movement and road vibration)</li>
          <li>Gyroscope data (motion and orientation)</li>
          <li>Magnetometer readings</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This sensor data cannot identify you personally. We use it to build environmental datasets for research and urban analysis.</p>

        <h3>Account information</h3>
        <p>When you sign in with Google, we collect your Google email, display name, Firebase UID, and device model / Android version.</p>

        <h3>Usage data</h3>
        <p>Upload session timing and frequency, app crashes, and feature usage (map views, settings changes).</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide core app features — tracking, uploading, maps</li>
          <li>Authenticate you via Google Sign-In</li>
          <li>Generate personal coverage maps</li>
          <li>Improve performance and fix bugs</li>
          <li>Ensure security and prevent abuse</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong class="text-white">We do not use your data for advertising.</strong> GreenGains has no ads.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your data. We share limited information only with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Firebase / Google</strong> — user authentication and crash reporting</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Neon (PostgreSQL)</strong> — database provider where sensor data is stored</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Legal authorities</strong> — only when required by law</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Environmental sensor data used for research is anonymized and cannot be traced back to you.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>All data transmitted over HTTPS</li>
          <li>Database encryption at rest</li>
          <li>Firebase Authentication for user accounts</li>
          <li>No storage of raw passwords or payment information</li>
        </ul>
        <p>While we use industry-standard security, no system is 100% secure.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Stop tracking anytime</strong> — turn off the service from inside the app</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Delete your data</strong> — email <a href="mailto:contact@eremat.org">contact@eremat.org</a></li>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Access your data</strong> — request a copy by email</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Correct information</strong> — update your Google account through Google</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Account information</strong> — until you request deletion</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white/80">Sensor and location data</strong> — stored indefinitely for research; anonymized after 90 days</li>
        </ul>
        <p>When you delete your account, personal information is removed within 30 days. Anonymized sensor data may remain in research datasets.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>GreenGains is not for users under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Policy Updates</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy occasionally. When we do, the "Effective Date" at the top of this page will change. Major changes will be announced in the app.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:contact@eremat.org">contact@eremat.org</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
